# These artifacts are consumed byte for byte by every language's provider TCK, and they are
# embedded verbatim into this module's compiled package. Normalise to LF so a checkout on
# Windows does not embed different bytes than one on Linux.
#
# Mirrors specification/assets/provider-tck/.gitattributes in open-feature/spec, which is
# where these files come from.
*.feature text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
*.yaml    text eol=lf
